OL,3,GNEWSAWhat to expect from a restored
OL,4,ABirnbeck Pier
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter years of a complex and costly
OL,7,Frefurbishment, Birnbeck Pier in
OL,8,FWeston-super-Mare is due to reopen in
OL,9,F2027.
OL,11,FThe iconic pier, the only one in the UK
OL,12,Fto link the mainland to an island,
OL,13,Fopened in 1867 and was visited by
OL,14,Fmillions before safety concerns led to
OL,15,Fits closure in 1994.
OL,17,FBut from next summer, visitors will be
OL,18,Fable to walk over to Birnbeck Island
OL,19,Ffor the first time in a generation.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
